<title>POLAND: CENTROSTAL MAY NET FALLS TO PLN 0.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>CENTROSTAL MAY NET FALLS TO PLN 0.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY			1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.12 vs   0.25</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.21 vs   0.46</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.43 vs   0.75</p>
<p> Sales		   10.82 vs   7.15</p>
<p> JANUARY-MAY	    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.44 vs   0.57</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.76 vs   1.02</p>
